{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Nolan enters the Samuel Adam’s, orders a drink, and sits down in a corner booth to start reading and note taking","created_at":"2021-07-26T19:22:14.919000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869298591158653028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"This book is a well written account of the long and lonely travels of a half blind God. He wondered at the world and walked the entire width and breadth of the it before it was split between old and new. This former God of Kings walked with with people, looking for secrets with which to accomplish goals that only he and his aspects huginn, muninn, geri, freki and slepinir knew.\nHe wandered, and where he did, branches of Yggdrasil would follow.","created_at":"2021-07-26T19:26:56.034000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T19:27:21.856000Z","id":"869299770240409610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"After a time, his travels left him a stranger to his people, he embraced aspects of his feminine nature. His physical form was not the massive hulking body of thor or baulder. He returned slender as loki and sif. Not only the God of Frenzy, but also the God of Poetry. Not only the God of Kings, but also the God of Theives. Not only a berzerker God of death, but also the God of healing.","created_at":"2021-07-26T19:33:27.892000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T19:34:24.889000Z","id":"869301413811990558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Through out the entire tale, be it wagers with freya, or the loss of his eye, or his own death and resurrection upon Yggdrasil, there is one theme resounds through out: Sacrifice begets power.","created_at":"2021-07-26T19:36:43.764000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869302235358715954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Lost wagers bring strength through the trials of repayment. The loss of his eye, doubled the glory of his battle prowess.\nAnd the secrets of all life were unlocked when he fell on his spear and bled against the world tree.","created_at":"2021-07-26T19:38:21.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869302646333394974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
